{"id":"630877","name":"奶黄包","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630877/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"130克"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯奶","amount":"150克"},{"name":"蛋黄","amount":"2个"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"50克"},{"name":"低粉","amount":"15克"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"15克"},{"name":"奶粉","amount":"20克"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"20克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主材料揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/630877/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"盖上湿布发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/630877/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入奶黄馅料所有材料放入碗里。","img":"images/630877/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/630877/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"全部倒入锅，小火慢慢煮。","img":"images/630877/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"成光滑面团，待温度合适。","img":"images/630877/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分成小剂子擀成包子皮。","img":"images/630877/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入奶黄馅料。","img":"images/630877/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"依次包好。","img":"images/630877/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入蒸锅，间隔开，在发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/630877/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"如图发酵好了。","img":"images/630877/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火蒸25分钟。","img":"images/630877/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图，早餐不错嘛。","img":"images/630877/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}